sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Admin Dashboard
    participant API as /api/documents/view
    participant S3 as Private AWS S3 Bucket

    Admin->>Frontend: Click "Review Identity Documents"
    Frontend->>API: GET /api/documents/view?id=doc_123
    API->>API: Check Admin Session Cookie
    alt Authorized Admin
        API->>S3: Generate Presigned GetObject Command
        S3-->>API: Short-lived Signed URL (15m expiry)
        API-->>Frontend: Redirect to Signed URL / Stream Buffer
        Frontend-->>Admin: Render NIC Front & Back Preview
    else Unauthorized User
        API-->>Frontend: 403 Forbidden
    end
